# STIG RHEL-09-653085: /var/log/audit perms-0700
# STIG ID: V-258166 (MEDIUM)

META
    esp_id `r9-rhel-09-653085-var-log-audit-perms-0700-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `rocky9`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG RHEL-09-653085: RHEL 9 audit log directory must be owned by root to prevent unauthorized read ac`
    description `RHEL 9 audit log directory must be owned by root to prevent unauthorized read access.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `rhel9,stig,disa-stig,permissions,filesystem`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:RHEL-09-653085,NIST-800-53:AU-9,NIST-800-53:SI-11`
    control_objective `AU-9`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Rocky9:localhost:os-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA STIG guidance for RHEL-09-653085.`

    component_id `comp-r9-os`

    impl_AU_9 `This control is validated by checking the required system configuration against the DISA STIG baseline for RHEL 9.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target
        path `/var/log/audit`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE meta_check
        exists boolean = true
        permissions string = `0700`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN file_metadata
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF meta_check
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
